flowchart TD
  A["forward pass<br/>predict with current parameters"]
  B["loss<br/>measure error as a number"]
  C["backpropagation<br/>compute gradients"]
  D["optimizer<br/>turn gradients into an update"]
  E["parameter update applied<br/>weights actually change"]

  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E

  B -. "what is wrong" .-> C
  C -. "which direction should change" .-> D
  D -. "apply the computed result as an actual move" .-> E
